& [SemanticExpansionRule]
  + each explicitly listed type field enum variant or function below is an added semantic element history event under the named per-path parent event
  + each child inherits turn conversation source requirement constraint plan before after evidence proof nonclaim frontier and change-set fields from its parent; operation is add unless an explicit override appears
  + locator is repository-relative file plus stable symbol identity; mutable line numbers are never element identities
  + before identity is absent for new A4 symbols; after identity resolves through the parent raw-byte digest and named symbol
  + field justification is the exact ordered Data Design and its stated identity expectation signature bounds truth or effect role; function justification is the associated implementation requirement matrix entry
  + the graph explicitly enumerates children to permit forward and reverse lookup from a protocol field or executable symbol to its justification frame

